  "description": "The proposed works comprise the repair and redecoration of the building’s external and internal communal areas, including the overhaul and repair of existing timber windows, with two windows replaced on a like-for-like basis where beyond repair. Works will also include localised repairs to masonry, render, brickwork, concrete, and natural stone using materials appropriate to the existing historic fabric, together with the redecoration of previously painted surfaces.\n\nInternal communal works will include repairs to walls, ceilings, joinery, and associated features, together with the replacement of floor finishes and upgrade of stair nosings to improve durability, safety, and appearance. All works are intended as a sympathetic programme of repair and maintenance that preserves the character and appearance of the building whilst enhancing its long-term condition and functionality.",
